WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.310
(audience applauding)
- So here's something

00:00:01.310 --> 00:00:02.143
that I'm obsessed with,

00:00:02.143 --> 00:00:03.770
and I wrote this in
your card in your room,

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:06.290
but I've never had my palm read.

00:00:06.290 --> 00:00:07.940
- And you had your palm
read in New Orleans.

00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:08.773
- I did, I did.

00:00:08.773 --> 00:00:09.606
- And here's the best part, like,

00:00:09.606 --> 00:00:11.680
tell them about the story,
because I love when you go back.

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:12.513
- Okay.

00:00:12.513 --> 00:00:14.640
So one of my producers from
another show called me,

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:16.107
he was following me on
Instagram, and said,

00:00:16.107 --> 00:00:18.010
"Hey, I see you're in New
Orleans, you should check out this

00:00:18.010 --> 00:00:19.640
palm reader and tarot card reader."

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:21.640
And I go, "I'm not (scoffs) what?

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:24.000
No, I'm not doing that,
this is ridiculous, no."

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:25.550
I happened to have some time to kill.

00:00:25.550 --> 00:00:27.307
I had about a half hour
or an hour and I said,

00:00:27.307 --> 00:00:28.460
"Okay, well, I'm in the area,

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:30.180
I'll go in the French Quarter
and I'll check it out."

00:00:30.180 --> 00:00:32.710
I go in, I'm like, "I'm not
gonna tell her anything.

00:00:32.710 --> 00:00:34.710
Stone poker-faced, not
gonna give her anything.

00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:37.350
I'm so not into this, I'm
pretty sure she's full of it.

00:00:37.350 --> 00:00:39.570
Let me see if I can just
find out what's going on."

00:00:39.570 --> 00:00:40.403
(audience laughs)
- I am so you.

00:00:40.403 --> 00:00:41.407
- I'm so like,
- I'd wanna throw them off.

00:00:41.407 --> 00:00:42.240
- "Whatever," I'm like, "Yeah, right."

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:43.073
- They're like "Do you like bananas?"

00:00:43.073 --> 00:00:44.160
I don't know.
- Yeah, like no.

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:44.993
- What do you think?

00:00:44.993 --> 00:00:46.030
Yeah, exactly.
- I don't know.

00:00:46.030 --> 00:00:47.177
- Exactly, I don't eat, what do you want,

00:00:47.177 --> 00:00:48.010
what do you want?
- I'm not sure.

00:00:48.010 --> 00:00:48.843
(laughing)

00:00:48.843 --> 00:00:49.700
- And I sat there and she, you know,

00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:51.290
I did tarot cards, she
did the whole thing,

00:00:51.290 --> 00:00:54.357
and I'm about 10 minutes in, I'm going,

00:00:54.357 --> 00:00:55.617
"Okay (surprised stammers)"

00:00:58.010 --> 00:00:59.997
And by the time it was over, I was like,

00:00:59.997 --> 00:01:01.450
"It's over?"

00:01:01.450 --> 00:01:02.690
I was like, "I need more."

00:01:02.690 --> 00:01:03.680
She was like "I have another appointment".

00:01:03.680 --> 00:01:05.850
I go, "Well are you available
in another half hour

00:01:05.850 --> 00:01:07.560
because I need to talk to you some more."

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:09.550
And I went to the bar like two doors down,

00:01:09.550 --> 00:01:10.487
I decided to drink a beer, and I'm like,

00:01:10.487 --> 00:01:12.160
"I gotta go back and talk to her."

00:01:12.160 --> 00:01:15.687
She had me, and I was
trying so hard, she had me.

00:01:15.687 --> 00:01:17.400
I'm sorry, guys, I'm a sucker.

00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:18.233
- Okay.

00:01:18.233 --> 00:01:19.850
I feel like I'm a sucker too, but, like,

00:01:19.850 --> 00:01:21.840
I kinda think that some people are

00:01:21.840 --> 00:01:24.180
extremely intuitive and
can, like, read stuff.

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:25.860
- It's in the cards, I mean, look.

00:01:25.860 --> 00:01:27.670
It's a specific thing the
cards are supposed to say,

00:01:27.670 --> 00:01:29.101
and they have specific meanings.

00:01:29.101 --> 00:01:31.410
Yeah, some of them could be
generic, but when you sit there,

00:01:31.410 --> 00:01:33.030
you know what's going on in your life,

00:01:33.030 --> 00:01:34.440
and if it's true, what are you gonna do?

00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:35.300
Lie about it?

00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:36.133
If it's true, you're gonna go,

00:01:36.133 --> 00:01:38.250
"Okay, that makes sense,
can I find out more?"

00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:40.180
Because she'll ask you
"Does this speak to you?"

00:01:40.180 --> 00:01:41.070
What, are you gonna lie?

00:01:41.070 --> 00:01:41.903
It's speaking to me.

00:01:41.903 --> 00:01:43.810
Yeah, I want that card,
I wanna talk about that.

00:01:43.810 --> 00:01:44.900
It's just one of those things.

00:01:44.900 --> 00:01:46.260
- Oh my gosh, I wanna do it so badly.

00:01:46.260 --> 00:01:47.170
- Trust me, I'm gonna give you her name.

00:01:47.170 --> 00:01:48.250
I'm gonna find out (drowned
out), I'll get in contact.

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:50.732
- We should do, like, a
piece where we both go again.

00:01:50.732 --> 00:01:52.189
Will you do it with me?
- Yeah, we should do it.

00:01:52.189 --> 00:01:53.812
Yes, Kelly Clarkson in New Orleans.

00:01:53.812 --> 00:01:54.924
We can do the food!

00:01:54.924 --> 00:01:56.207
- I love New Orleans!

